Make the online server list optional (YS_NO_SERVER_LIST).

The server-list button downloads https://ysflight.org/serverlist/ with curl
on a detached std::thread and parses it with nlohmann-json. Neither library
is in the RISC OS devkit, so with YS_NO_SERVER_LIST (always on RISC OS, or
-DYS_NO_SERVER_LIST=ON) the download is compiled out and the button shows
the existing "server list unavailable" dialog; the host is typed in.
Also: find_package(CURL) without CONFIG, since distro curl packages have no
CURLConfig.cmake (only vcpkg does).

For YSCE 231e711. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-ysflight.

